      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_7_2906-3013",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "2906-3013",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你是一个什么样的人？（自我概念） 你擅长的行为模式是什么？（特质） 你的热爱、你的动力在哪里？（动机）",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 22556012,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_5_1384-1418",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "1384-1418",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成年人的第一个重要任务：发现自己的优势，并在日复一日的工作中发挥它。",
      "totalCount": 364
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 419939131,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_8_1966-2020",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "1966-2020",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "也许是因为我们想成为“更好的自己”而不得，是我不够努力，是我不够优秀。但那个所谓“更好的自己”，其实是别人。",
      "totalCount": 342
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 34798278,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_13_571-645",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "571-645",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一个人的改变就发生在：从先满足别人的需求，到先满足自己的需求。",
      "totalCount": 340
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 296495095,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_39_840-861",
      "chapterUid": 39,
      "range": "840-861",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "哪种作息时间会帮助你更快、更容易恢复精力？",
      "totalCount": 336
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 599800397,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_3_2896-2919",
      "chapterUid": 3,
      "range": "2896-2919",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "那些阻碍我们进步的，恰恰就是我们坚信不疑的事。",
      "totalCount": 324
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 933284094,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_10_1552-1618",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "1552-1618",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这就是看了太多人生指南，反而找不到北了。因为这些知识没有跟你和你的生命经验联结，没办法对你这个“人”产生意义，反而会带来无端的困扰。",
      "totalCount": 315
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 419939131,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_35_1018-1078",
      "chapterUid": 35,
      "range": "1018-1078",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "比如你恨不得每天都要输入，不管是看书看资料还是看美剧，还是听课找人取经，反正就是要输入些什么，不然就觉得自己快要干涸了。",
      "totalCount": 289
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 383029873,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_13_2059-2074",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "2059-2074",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "别人笑你时，你可以不用跟着笑。",
      "totalCount": 288
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 585610520,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_8_3833-3853",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "3833-3853",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不是成为更好的自己，而是更好地成为自己。",
      "totalCount": 286
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 34798278,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_12_2532-2594",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "2532-2594",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "现在那些佛系、躺平的人，在某种程度上是对生活和工作的抗拒。容易放弃只是现象，背后的本质是始终没有找到自己心中的那个“确定”。",
      "totalCount": 270
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 385785068,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_6_1655-1670",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "1655-1670",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人有时候不怕努力，就怕瞎努力。",
      "totalCount": 253
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 394252043,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_5_5282-5328",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "5282-5328",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "而学习力优势者一天不吸收新知识，就会觉得自己的人生荒废了，他们对这个世界永远饥渴、充满好奇。",
      "totalCount": 238
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 22556012,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_13_2940-2975",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "2940-2975",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“你哪有困惑，你只是需要确认，愿你早日实现不再需要确认就笃定的那天。”",
      "totalCount": 238
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 396963022,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_35_1494-1532",
      "chapterUid": 35,
      "range": "1494-1532",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们经过访谈和研讨，把学习者分成了三类：书本学习者、人际学习者和行动学习者。",
      "totalCount": 238
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 9887752,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_25_1881-1987",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "1881-1987",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "情绪价值不是从自己身上硬往外掏，而是人和人之间自然流淌出来的。这里就有一个前提，你能真正地拥抱差异，看见和认可员工的个体价值。",
      "totalCount": 234
    },
    {
      "bookId": "3300075844",
      "userVid": 419939131,
      "bookmarkId": "3300075844_12_2042-2105",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "2042-2105",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当一个人找到自己的生存缝隙时，就会用优势视角向内定制自己的标准，知道自己是谁，往哪里去，这样就产生一个连带效应：他会变得坚毅。",
      "totalCount": 225
    }
